{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Ping Pong Deluxe",
    "steam_appid": 2539840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539840/extras/b549c4085569cfa7044f7626a54c4583.webp?t=1734885202\" /></span><br>Dive into the world of Ping Pong Deluxe and choose from 5 maps and different game modes that will put your skills to the test. During the game, collect valuable keys to unlock new items with which you can personalize your character.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539840/extras/0a523f312bd70ccbc820eb066d4e4dc0.webp?t=1734885202\" /></span><br>Currently, there are five cool maps that you can play in Ping Pong Deluxe. Each of these maps offers a unique gaming experience and a challenge that will put your ping pong skills to the test.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539840/extras/92e06927a53d982fc646e1bc2be551cc.webp?t=1734885202\" /></span><br>Show off your skills in the thrilling local &quot;PVP Mode&quot; (two controllers on one computer or two people on one keyboard), challenge the computer opponent in &quot;COM Mode&quot;, discover the &quot;POWER-UP Mode&quot; with exciting effects or create your very own challenge in &quot;CUSTOM Mode&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539840/extras/89a7867a442069070d018d0efb6e6864.webp?t=1734885202\" /></span><br>Currently, 40 unique items await you to individualise your player and to customise the map colours. Give your character a personal touch and design the playing fields colours according to your taste.<br><br>Become the undisputed table tennis champion!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539840/extras/b549c4085569cfa7044f7626a54c4583.webp?t=1734885202\" /></span><br>Dive into the world of Ping Pong Deluxe and choose from 5 maps and different game modes that will put your skills to the test. During the game, collect valuable keys to unlock new items with which you can personalize your character.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539840/extras/0a523f312bd70ccbc820eb066d4e4dc0.webp?t=1734885202\" /></span><br>Currently, there are five cool maps that you can play in Ping Pong Deluxe. Each of these maps offers a unique gaming experience and a challenge that will put your ping pong skills to the test.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539840/extras/92e06927a53d982fc646e1bc2be551cc.webp?t=1734885202\" /></span><br>Show off your skills in the thrilling local &quot;PVP Mode&quot; (two controllers on one computer or two people on one keyboard), challenge the computer opponent in &quot;COM Mode&quot;, discover the &quot;POWER-UP Mode&quot; with exciting effects or create your very own challenge in &quot;CUSTOM Mode&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2539840/extras/89a7867a442069070d018d0efb6e6864.webp?t=1734885202\" /></span><br>Currently, 40 unique items await you to individualise your player and to customise the map colours. Give your character a personal touch and design the playing fields colours according to your taste.<br><br>Become the undisputed table tennis champion!",
    "short_description": "Ping Pong Deluxe immerses you in a world of table tennis that revolutionizes the classic game with new modes and different maps! Here you get fast-paced rallies and dynamic gameplay that will keep you enthralled. Become the undisputed table tennis champion!",
